          "attachments": {},
          "contentMode": "map",
          "image": "",
          "imageCaption": "",
          "markdown": "**The outline the first map refused to draw now exists. Twice, and the two do\nnot agree.**\n\nHOT put the water line at **31.7 km²**, UNOSAT at\n**64.9 km²**. Both careful, different ground.\n\n**On the map:** blue fill is HOT · violet outline is UNOSAT · dots are graded buildings\n",
          "paneAlignment": "start",
          "panelWidth": "34%",
          "title": "What has been published since"
        }
      }
    },
    "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8001-000000000003": {
      "name": "What the river looks like now",
      "type": "StorySegmentLayer",
      "visible": true,
      "parameters": {
        "zoom": 12.4,
        "extent": [
          9486174.214261191,
          3265273.068968073,
          9518845.851620333,
          3289342.333724676
        ],
        "transition": {
          "type": "linear",
          "time": 2.2
        },
        "layerOverride": [
          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
            "visible": true,
            "opacity": 0.25
          },
          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
            "visible": false,
            "opacity": 1.0
          },
          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
            "visible": false,
            "opacity": 1.0
          },
          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
            "visible": false,
            "opacity": 1.0
          },
          {
