          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-00000000000d",
            "visible": false,
            "opacity": 1.0
          }
        ],
        "content": {
          "attachments": {
            "fig-gradient-vs-damage.png": {
              "image/png": ""
            }
          },
          "contentMode": "markdown",
          "image": "",
          "imageCaption": "",
          "markdown": "**Bed gradient was measured from terrain tiles two days after the flood, before\nanyone knew what had been lost. Bridge losses were mapped a week later.**\n\n![Bed gradient and bridge losses over the same three reaches](attachment:fig-gradient-vs-damage.png)\n\nThe two profiles are the same shape. That is the first map's central claim\nholding up: how steep the riverbed is decides whether water arrives as a wall or\nas a rise, and the wall is what takes bridges out.\n\nIt is one measure against one outcome, over three reaches, so it is a match\nrather than a proof. But it is the right kind of match, and it was available on\nday two.\n",
          "paneAlignment": "start",
          "panelWidth": "34%",
          "title": "The shape the first map guessed, and the shape that happened"
        }
      }
    },
    "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8001-000000000005": {
      "name": "The bridges, and whether the numbers can be compared yet",
      "type": "StorySegmentLayer",
      "visible": true,
      "parameters": {
        "zoom": 12.6,
        "extent": [
          9490292.627621658,
          3270495.3411943763,
          9518734.939928468,
          3291448.8531863606
        ],
        "transition": {
          "type": "linear",
          "time": 2.0
        },
        "layerOverride": [
          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
            "visible": true,
            "opacity": 0.25
          },
          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
            "visible": true,
            "opacity": 1.0
          },
          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
            "visible": false,
            "opacity": 1.0
