        "content": {
          "attachments": {},
          "contentMode": "map",
          "image": "",
          "imageCaption": "",
          "markdown": "**The flood left something behind, and it is still there.**\n\nUNOSAT detected **two barrier lakes** on imagery of 28 August,\n**20 ha** and\n**12 ha**, where debris dammed the channel. They\nsit above a valley that has just lost most of its bridges.\n\nPreliminary, and not validated in the field.\n\n**On the map:** the teal shapes are the two lakes\n",
          "paneAlignment": "start",
          "panelWidth": "34%",
          "title": "Two new lakes above the valley"
        }
      }
    },
    "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8001-000000000013": {
      "name": "Sources",
      "type": "StorySegmentLayer",
      "visible": true,
      "parameters": {
        "zoom": 10.0,
        "extent": [
          9360896.486414863,
          3185971.5452115457,
          9533338.422228033,
          3313009.8862228445
        ],
        "transition": {
          "type": "linear",
          "time": 2.0
        },
        "layerOverride": [
          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
            "visible": true,
            "opacity": 0.25
          },
          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
            "visible": true,
            "opacity": 1.0
          },
          {
            "targetLayer": "2c7f4b20-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
            "visible": false,
            "opacity": 1.0
